  "content": "\n\n<h1><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fr%252fbareneil%252fminecraft-server-hosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1475587/description_7bacedcb-1d61-4bd0-8d04-cb8a0b267406.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"81\"></a></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Совместимость Bundle Texture Pack&nbsp;<em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-mod-support-unofficial\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Interfaces — Неофициальная поддержка модов</a></em></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-mod-support-unofficial\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zW0OkthM/e9f003365e0bd2251993b6ae30bfca6ae2d6c56a.png\" alt=\"Immersive Interfaces — Неофициальная поддержка модов\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>Частичная совместимость с другими:</strong></em></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-curios-api-mod-support\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_abbc37df-dab3-456d-8af4-12acb6e98bea.png\" alt=\"Immersive Interfaces — Поддержка мода Curios API\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-trinkets-mod-support\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_725e17b5-3d84-444c-b3f7-7fdf64f8b436.png\" alt=\"Immersive Interfaces — Поддержка мода Trinkets\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-cosmetic-armor-reworked-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_35671bdb-dd62-4da0-a6a6-d4433b1e3f6d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_29d985aa-9597-47ad-b9dd-34328e684b54.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_7ce1a2e6-a04a-4531-b400-6cb5211ab87e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-just-enough-items-jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_614f15c2-433a-497c-a85d-7497ded65b08.png\" alt=\"Immersive Interfaces — Just Enough Items (JEI)\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-accesories-curios-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_3bb78bab-4957-43ff-a994-af576e65339f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-sophisticated-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_7c5c0c44-933c-47df-97b7-0e734d41b1ed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-spell-engine-rpg-series\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_b862eba6-89be-4a71-965b-f40a34e8c46c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-quark\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_f7df0cf5-a4c7-43da-834c-bbf3d7cee1bd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-travelers-backpack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_33e72ccd-8ca5-4657-92d9-66d6d1f3c263.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-roughly-enough-items-rei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_b7eca5eb-ada1-430e-8145-d1119a92314d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-roughly-enough-items-rei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1444975/description_f739db58-1fdc-4ace-892f-a9d1dd942848.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong style=\"text-align:left\">Этот пакет текстур обеспечивает совместимость с Sophisticated Backpacks &amp; Storage, интегрируя его элементы дизайна в визуальный стиль Immersive Interfaces.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>До:</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cdea9daa-c8b9-4815-bb9d-5562f40c53fb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"680\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>После:</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8e4cd5b0-ad8e-4f7b-a130-b43f0f9754ec.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"680\"></strong></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"width:22px\">&nbsp;</div>\